    "description": "Episode 10 brings the live grid. Live quotes streams: a snapshot over HTTP, then each quote ticks in place over live-grid's websocket, with logos and 52-week ranges. Beside it, the subscription list, one symbol's kdb+ tick history, the Live Chart, the Cached Price Chart and an S&P 500 sector map. Add the stack's live-grid backend (its live profile) as a connection. Opens in BDOBB 10.0.0 or later.",
